Agentic RAG Stack

Services:
  nix run .#dev              # Start PostgreSQL (ParadeDB) + Ollama

Indexing:
  just index /path/to/repo   # Index a codebase

Database:
  psql postgres://127.0.0.1:5432/codebase

MCP server:
  just build                 # Build the Rust binary
  just mcp                   # Run the MCP server
  nix build .#agentix-mcp-server  # Build with Nix (requires Cargo.lock)

Quick search (no services needed):
  ck search 'query'              # ad-hoc hybrid search
  ck --serve                     # lightweight MCP server
  ccusage                        # Claude Code usage stats

